{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/NewAboutUs2.png?t=1743797953\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Evercore Heroes: Ascension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>co-op-first Hero Roguelite</strong> where teamwork and mastery forge legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEFEND THE EVERCORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a <strong>Luum Sentinel</strong>, you are one of the last heroes standing against Fate\u2019s Blade, a sinister force seeking to corrupt Lumerea\u2019s magic. The Evercore\u2014source of balance and life\u2014has been shattered, and only by recovering its fragments can you restore order before chaos takes hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face relentless trials, battle formidable enemies, and adapt your strategy with every run. Whether you fight <strong>solo or with a team</strong>, every mission is a new challenge\u2014<strong>fall, rise stronger, and protect the Evercore!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/CoOpENA.png?t=1743797953\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/CoopENA.gif?t=1743797953\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TRUE CO-OP HERO ROGUELITE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Designed for teamwork, but playable solo</strong>, every mission tests your skill, coordination, and adaptability. Play your role, cover your allies, and overcome impossible odds together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DYNAMIC MISSIONS, ENDLESS REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch from Castle Everae into <strong>procedural missions</strong> packed with devious monsters, rewarding challenges, and intense boss fights\u2014all wrapped into tight, <strong>30-minute adventures</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/HeroEN.png?t=1743797953\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/HeroENA.gif?t=1743797953\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASTER UNIQUE HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and refine over a dozen <strong>Heroes</strong>, each with unique powerful abilities, playstyles, and personality.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/StrategizeEN.png?t=1743797953\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/BuildENA.gif?t=1743797953\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EVOLVE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from <strong>Tank, Damage, and Support</strong>, then <strong>reshape your role</strong> with Shards, <strong>game-changing upgrades</strong> that let you <strong>break the meta</strong> and experiment with powerful new builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/ProgressEN.png?t=1743797953\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/UpgradeENA.gif?t=1743797953\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUILD YOUR LEGACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress persists. <strong>Unlock new abilities, strengthen your heroes</strong>, and craft consumables at Castle Everae to push further with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/ExploreEN.png?t=1743797953\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/TravelENA.gif?t=1743797953\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE A LIVING SCIENCE-FANTASY WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through the <strong>Five Realms of Lumerea</strong>, from the frozen peaks of <strong>Kru</strong> to the vibrant jungles of <strong>Moxy</strong>, and uncover the rich stories of this beautiful but perilous world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rally your team, embrace the challenge, and become the heroes Lumerea needs!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2586780?t=1743797953","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743797953","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/68ba02f20afc7a373846980aa949d7038aa62846/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743797953","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/68ba02f20afc7a373846980aa949d7038aa62846/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743797953","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i