 Everae to push further with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/ExploreEN.png?t=1743797953\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/TravelENA.gif?t=1743797953\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE A LIVING SCIENCE-FANTASY WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through the <strong>Five Realms of Lumerea</strong>, from the frozen peaks of <strong>Kru</strong> to the vibrant jungles of <strong>Moxy</strong>, and uncover the rich stories of this beautiful but perilous world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rally your team, embrace the challenge, and become the heroes Lumerea needs!</strong></p>","developers":["Vela Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/header.jpg?t=1743797953","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Evercore Heroes is a registered trade / logo mark of Vela Games, Ltd. Evercore Heroes: Ascension Copywrite 2025","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257099639,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099639/movie480.mp4?t=1739887238","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099639/movie_max.mp4?t=1739887238"},"name":"Cinematic Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass